---
import {regions} from './quorum.mjs';
---
<figure aria-labelledby="r29-votes-title">
  <figcaption id="r29-votes-title"><span class="figure-label">Figure 1</span> Count votes that can communicate</figcaption>
  <regional-votes>
    <p class="premise">One replica group · five voting replicas · a majority needs three</p>
    <div class="regions">
      {regions.map((r,i) => <div class="region" data-region={r.name}>
        <strong>{r.name}</strong><p>{r.votes} voting {r.votes === 1 ? 'replica' : 'replicas'}</p>
        <div class="votes">{Array.from({length:r.votes},(_,j)=><span data-vote>V{i*2+j+1} ✓</span>)}</div>
        <label><input type="checkbox" value={r.name} /> {r.name} unavailable</label>
        <p class="status" data-status>Running</p>
      </div>)}
    </div>
    <label class="links">Links between surviving regions
      <select data-links><option value="connected">Survivors can communicate</option><option value="isolated">Every region isolated from the others</option></select>
    </label>
    <p data-count>5 running votes; largest communicating group: 5.</p>
    <p class="result" data-result aria-live="polite">A majority is possible: at least 3 votes can communicate.</p>
  </regional-votes>
  <p class="note">An illustrative fixed membership, not a native outage test. “Possible” checks only this group’s voting condition. Election, leader or lease transfer, routing, other replica groups and service dependencies still matter.</p>
  <details><summary>Read the failure cases</summary><p>With all survivors connected, losing eu-north or eu-west leaves three votes; losing us-east leaves four. Each single-region loss retains a majority. Losing any two regions leaves at most two votes, so none can form a majority. With all three regions isolated, even five running votes are divided into groups of two, two and one: none has three. Additional unavailable regions cannot improve that.</p></details>
</figure>
<script>
  import {quorum} from './quorum.mjs';
  class RegionalVotes extends HTMLElement {
    connectedCallback() {
      if(this.dataset.ready) return; this.dataset.ready='true';
      const update=()=>{
        const inputs=[...this.querySelectorAll<HTMLInputElement>('input')];
        const result=quorum(inputs.filter(i=>i.checked).map(i=>i.value),this.querySelector<HTMLSelectElement>('select')!.value==='connected');
        inputs.forEach(input=>{
          const card=input.closest<HTMLElement>('[data-region]')!;
          card.classList.toggle('unavailable',input.checked);
          card.querySelector('[data-status]')!.textContent=input.checked?'Unavailable':'Running';
          card.querySelectorAll('[data-vote]').forEach(v=>v.textContent=v.textContent!.replace(/[✓×]/,input.checked?'×':'✓'));
        });
        this.querySelector('[data-count]')!.textContent=`${result.available} running ${result.available===1?'vote':'votes'}; largest communicating group: ${result.largest}.`;
        this.querySelector('[data-result]')!.textContent=result.possible?'A majority is possible: at least 3 votes can communicate.':'No majority: no communicating group has the required 3 votes.';
      };
      this.addEventListener('change',update); update();
    }
  }
  customElements.define('regional-votes',RegionalVotes);
</script>
<style>
  figure{margin:2.5rem 0}figcaption{font:1.25rem/1.4 var(--font-serif);margin-bottom:.8rem}.figure-label{font:.75rem var(--font-sans);text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--color-text-secondary);margin-right:.6rem}
  regional-votes{display:block;border:1px solid var(--color-text-secondary);padding:1rem;font-family:var(--font-sans);font-size:.9rem;line-height:1.5}
  .premise{margin:0 0 1rem}.regions{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:.75rem}.region{border:1px solid var(--color-text-secondary);padding:.75rem;min-width:0;background:var(--color-surface)}.region p{margin:.4rem 0}.votes{display:flex;gap:.4rem;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:.8rem 0}.votes span{padding:.2rem .4rem;border:1px solid var(--color-text-secondary)}.region label{display:block;font-size:.8rem}.region input{accent-color:var(--color-accent)}.region.unavailable{border-style:dashed}.status{font-weight:600}.links{display:block;margin-top:1rem}.links select{display:block;width:100%;margin-top:.3rem;padding:.5rem;color:var(--color-text);background:var(--color-surface);border:1px solid var(--color-text-secondary);font:inherit}.result{border-left:3px solid var(--color-accent);padding:.6rem .8rem;margin-bottom:0}.note,details{font-family:var(--font-sans);font-size:.85rem;line-height:1.5;color:var(--color-text-secondary)}details{margin-top:.75rem}summary{cursor:pointer}@media(max-width:600px){.regions{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
</style>
